            "review_title": "Review at Cá Mặn Vietnamese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thomas G\nZurich, Switzerland82 contributions\n0\nVietnamese that convinces, even for skeptics\nApr 2026 • Couples\nVery good Vietnamese restaurant and a clear recommendation for people who may not appreciate the Vietnamese food as much. \n\nThe food was outstandingly good and the service was top. We had various appetizers, a pho and a fish dish, which also tasted very good.\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten May 2, 2026",
