            "review_title": "Review at Cá Mặn Vietnamese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Fiona B\nMelbourne, Australia183 contributions\n0\nLovely venue, staff and great meals\nApr 2026 • Couples\nWe went here for lunch. Staff are polite and attentive with great spoken english. Had the best spring rolls do far on aur trip here. Also ordered Da nang chicken rice which was tasty but not overly hot. My partner ordered bamboo grilled beef which he enjoyed. I also had a cold ice coffee which was great and strong. \nFood was great, presentation lovely and reasonably priced.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nSpring rolls, Ice coffee\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 10, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
