            "review_title": "Review at Cá Mặn Vietnamese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "freediveballenaazul\n26 contributions\n0\nA big disappointment...\nMar 2026 • Couples\nWe chose the restaurant because of the good reviews and were very disappointed. The one meal, chicken with chilli, was okay, but just lukewarm. After multiple reminders, the second meal can only take about 20 minutes later, which is not a professional achievement. The fish was then dry, the side dishes cold. Just in passing, it should be noted that the portions are rather small. In view of these shortcomings, the apology and the partial price waiver - after all, something - are not enough to justify a better assessment.\nRead more\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten March 11, 2026",
