            "review_text": "Carol C\n1 contribution\n0\nAuthentic and special.\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nWe have been in Vietnam for a week now and at this lovely restaurant we had the best authentic Vietnamese food yet.\nAll of our dushes were full of flavour - no chillies as requested!!\nThe staff all had a serene manner which helped make this a truly enjoyable and memorable meal. \nThe lanterns were so decorative a added to that aithenticity.\nWe must make a special mention and compliment to Thai. This young man was attentive in a non intrusive way, we loved talking with him and hope in some small way it helped him gain in confidence when speaking English. Good luck for the future Thai.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGo there.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 26, 2026",
